      "x": 430,
      "y": 548,
      "w": 850,
      "h": 758,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "Resolver · read-only identity; inbound depends on SKU"
    },
    {
      "x": 430,
      "y": 1320,
      "w": 850,
      "h": 376,
      "tone": "amber",
      "title": "P97 optional sync job and switch evidence"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "scan",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 68,
      "w": 362,
      "h": 420,
      "tone": "slate",
      "title": "1 · Finish the whole scan",
      "lines": [
        "Snapshot: [[snapshot]]",
        "Export uses the operator's Graph token; in-VNet reads use the writer's grant.",
        "Read users and service principals transitively; follow every [[next]].",
        "[[reconcile]] records scan start as [[verified]], a UUID [[generation]], and a [[expiry]].",
        "A failed scan publishes nothing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "writer",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 68,
      "w": 372,
      "h": 420,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "2 · Reconcile changes only",
      "lines": [
        "[[writer]] acquires [[apply-lock]] before reads.",
        "Snapshot import must be before its apply-by deadline.",
        "Page existing records with [[fetch]]; write in bounded [[upsert]] batches.",
        "Write added, moved and changed records. Delete orphans on a full sync.",
        "[[sync-access]] can target one user; [[runner-start]] starts the runner when stopped."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "store",
      "x": 878,
      "y": 68,
      "w": 386,
      "h": 420,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "3 · Cosmos DB entitlement",
      "lines": [
        "One record per oid; id and partition key are that oid.",
        "Carries tenant, tier, unit / team, mapping version and verification metadata.",
        "Writer: Data Contributor on one container. Resolver: Data Reader on that container.",
        "[[network]] defaults to private-only. Key authentication is off.",
        "Records persist until a sync deletes or changes them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cache",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 614,
      "w": 362,
      "h": 304,
      "tone": "blue",
      "title": "4 · Cache hit or miss",
      "lines": [
        "Key: [[key]]",
        "A valid positive answer is cached for [[ttl]].",
        "Cache expiry is not entitlement expiry.",
        "A miss goes to admission below.",
        "Negative cache: min(60s, configured window)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "admit",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 946,
      "w": 362,
      "h": 330,
      "tone": "blue",
      "title": "5 · Admission before lookup",
      "lines": [
        "[[misses]]",
        "At most 200 misses/s and 100 concurrent misses.",
        "Beyond that envelope: retryable 429, Retry-After 1.",
        "Within it: gateway MI calls the resolver; 5-second request timeout.",
        "Approximate, not a throughput guarantee."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "function",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 614,
      "w": 374,
      "h": 304,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "6 · Authenticated Function",
      "lines": [
        "GET [[route]]",
        "[[auth]] allows the gateway identity, correct tenant and audience only.",
        "[[inbound]] = private, except Basic v2 public+Entra.",
        "Two warm 2-GB instances; 100 HTTP requests each.",
        "No result cache after a read."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "singleflight",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 946,
      "w": 374,
      "h": 330,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "7 · One read per identity / process",
      "lines": [
        "[[lookup]] shares concurrent same-oid reads.",
        "100 distinct in-flight reads per process; 3.5-second deadline and abort signal.",
        "Cosmos transport timeout: 2.5 seconds; throttling retries disabled.",
        "An aborted read keeps its slot until transport settles. No cross-host single flight."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validate",
      "x": 878,
      "y": 614,
      "w": 386,
      "h": 304,
      "tone": "teal",
      "title": "8 · Validate the stored record",
      "lines": [
        "[[to-entitlement]]",
        "Check tenant, supported tier, generation and scan time.",
        "Read by id + partition key over the Cosmos private endpoint.",
        "Missing or future verification metadata is invalid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome",
      "x": 878,
      "y": 946,
      "w": 386,
      "h": 330,
      "tone": "amber",
      "title": "9 · Distinguish absence from fault",
      "lines": [
        "Valid entitled record: return 200; continue the gateway policy.",
        "Missing / not-yet-effective record: resolver 404 becomes gateway 403.",
        "Malformed record or resolver failure: gateway 503, Retry-After 5.",
        "No fallback to old lists. A healthy retry is not proof that membership changed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "renewal-job",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 1364,
      "w": 818,
      "h": 320,
      "tone": "amber",
      "title": "10 · Optional sync job and switch evidence",
      "lines": [
        "[[deploy-renewal]]: every 2 h by default; 30m-12h or manual.",
        "[[registry-template]]: [[acr]], [[renewal-identity]], AcrPull.",
        "[[renewal-template]]: [[cae-env]], [[cae-job]], [[cosmos-writer]].",
        "Logs and alerts: [[renewal-logs]], [[renewal-alerts]].",
        "Unit reads: [[unit-reader]], [[unit-read]].",
        "Switch compare: runner or [[compare-snapshot]].",
        "[[admission-check]]: full sync <24h; no invalid record.",
        "[[switch]]: backup, one [[entitlement-source]] write."
      ]
    }
  ],
